tus":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段完整敘事、引語角色與明示近親官職辨識；非按同名批量合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-024-cuilin","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-024","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-024-cuilin"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p056","text":"十五年，季文子使於晉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m056-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"季文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p059","text":"十八年，宣公卒，子成公黑肱立，是爲成公。季文子曰：『使我殺適立庶失大援者，襄仲。』襄仲立宣公，公孫歸父有寵。宣公欲去三桓，與晉謀伐三桓。會宣公卒，季文子怨之，歸父奔齊。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"成公黑肱","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"季文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"襄仲","kind":"person","person_id":"9rn_poi_ayp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"襄仲","kind":"person","person_id":"9rn_poi_ayp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0047","start":47,"end":51,"surface":"公孫歸父","kind":"person","person_id":"gv8_tj5_hcy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0